{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hhsurf/items/991/", "pk": 991, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/hhsurf/", "pk": 41, "shortname": "hhsurf", "name": "Hans Hedemann South Shore (Queen Kapiolani)", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Surf Lessons", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Surf Lessons", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": true, "is_free_allowed": false, "is_no_tax": false, "sortable_index": -200, "description": "#Our talented surf teachers will coach you through the best ride of your life! \n\n##Duration\n2 Hours\n\n##About\n**What to expect:**\nIn two hours or less, you’ll be surfing—guaranteed. Whether you’re a beginner or advanced surfer, young or old, nervous or eager—we’ll make sure you get the most effective coaching.\n\n**Two hours surf lesson consist of a safety briefing and instruction on land.**\n\n**Group Lesson:**\nOne of our most popular lessons, the group lesson is perfect for first-time surfers.\nWe start with basic water safety principles and a land lesson before going in the ocean. If you don’t have a group, no worries! We’ll put one together for you. Must be 14 years or older for group lesson.\n\n**Semi-Private Lesson**\nThe semi-private lesson accommodates up to three students. It’s perfect for couples, friends or family members who want to learn surfing together and get personalized coaching from one instructor. You’ll be able to catch more waves than the group lesson. Even better, your instructor will adjust to each person’s skill level.\n\n**Private lessons:**\nWe recommend private lessons for children between the ages of 5 and 14, intermediate to advanced surfers, beginners and those who just want the extra attention. Your instructor will be able to guide you and teach you whatever you want to learn—whether it’s mastering the bottom turn or learning how to carve the wave. \n\n**What to bring:**\nSwimsuit, towel and sunscreen. (Rashguard, reef shoes and surfboard rentals are FREE with lesson.)", "description_text": "While visiting Hawaii, a surf lesson is a must. Whether you are a beginner, intermediate, or advanced surfer, our Waikiki surf lessons are a great fit for all ability levels. You are guaranteed to be surfing within the two-hour lesson thanks to our world-class surf instructors, so come catch some waves with us!", "description_bullets": "Our industry-leading lessons and instructors get you surfing in two hours or less\n\nGroup, semi-private, and private lessons available, depending on your needs and background\n\nAll experience levels welcome! Our instructors guarantee to deliver the attention you need", "seo_description": "", "location": "Waikiki", "booking_notes": "**Rashguard, reef shoes, and surfboard rental is included in the price.**\n\n#[Click here for map](https://goo.gl/maps/Xclwi)\n\n**For safety reasons:**\n\n- Must be physically able to swim and in good physical condition for paddling. \n- Not recommended for pregnant women. \n- Not recommended for children under the age of 14 (Children's Private lessons are also offered!) \n- Bring Towel and Sunscreen.\n\n**Hans Hedemann Surf**\ninfo@hhsurf.com\n808-924-7778\n[http://hhsurf.com/hh/en/index.html](http://hhsurf.com/hh/en/index.html)", "canc